                <pb facs="0612" n="524" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg524"/>

                <head>Treaty between the United States and the Kingdom of the Netherlands, extending
                    the extradition convention of June 2, 1887, between the two countries to their
                    respective island possessions and colonies</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, January 18, 1904.<lb/>Ratification
                        advised by the Senate, January 27, 1904.<lb/>Ratified by the President, May
                        26, 1904.<lb/>Ratified by The Netherlands, April 4, 1904.<lb/>Ratifications
                        exchanged at Washington, May 28, 1904.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Proclaimed, May 31, 1904.</hi></p>

